        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Susan had just stepped away to answer the phone, but when she returned she saw something pulling her son Jimmy through a shimmering portal. It closed before she could pull him back. To save him, she must find a way to this other world. Before Susan lies a world that no one else has ever seen before... a world where magic is real and anything is possible. Find out who took Jimmy and what they want in Lost Lands: Dark Overlord!",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Susan acababa de alejarse para contestar el teléfono, pero al volver vio que algo arrastraba a su hijo Jimmy a través de un portal centelleante. El portal se cerró antes de que pudiera recuperarlo. Para salvarlo, debe encontrar la manera de llegar a ese otro mundo. Ante Susan se extiende un mundo que nadie había visto antes: un mundo donde la magia es real y todo es posible. ¡Descubre quién se llevó a Jimmy y qué quiere en Lost Lands: Dark Overlord!",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2015",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
